/E (Regarding training, UFOP offers a wide range of first, second and third cycle programs, covering many disciplines such as engineering, pharmacy, social sciences, arts and letters, natural sciences or still healthy. It is also well known for its mining and metallurgical engineering programs, due to its heritage with the Minas school.)
/Pg 13 0 R
