307 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In addition, UFOP stands out in the field of research through its contributions in various scientific fields. The university is home to several cutting-edge research centers and actively encourages innovation and international collaboration. In particular, it participates in research projects in partnership with Brazilian and foreign institutions, which strengthens its position on the global academic scene.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (UFOP also offers a student life very rich in cultural, social and sporting activities. Students benefit from an environment conducive to their intellectual and personal development, with numerous opportunities for community projects, student clubs or cultural events. The university also organizes festivals and events to celebrate the historical and cultural heritage of the region, thus strengthening the identity of the school.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
