/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After cleaning the database and filtering the comments to keep only those in French, the next step consists of training an artificial intelligence model capable of determining whether a comment is favorable or unfavorable to the use of electronic cigarettes. This step involves several technical and methodological challenges, in particular the creation of a labeling file which will serve as a training basis for our model.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
