<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Once the model is trained and validated, it will be used to automatically classify the remaining comments in the database, providing an overview of public opinions on e-cigarettes in France. This process will generate valuable insights and contribute to a better understanding of attitudes and perceptions towards electronic cigarettes, while paving the way for more in-depth analyses.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
