/E (In a multilingual context, biases can emerge, especially when a model is trained mainly on French data. These biases can affect model performance, including its ability to correctly interpret comments with specific linguistic or cultural nuances. Using multilingual pre-trained models like BERT is crucial to minimizing these biases, but additional adjustments may be necessary, such as adding additional training data for French language dialects or variants.)
