668 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This report describes a research project aimed at characterizing coordinated behaviors related to electronic cigarettes on social networks, with particular emphasis on the French context. The main objective was to build a comprehensive dataset from YouTube comments and videos to reflect public perceptions, debates and attitudes towards e-cigarettes in France.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
669 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Data Collection)
/E (Data Collection)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
670 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The data collection phase resulted in the creation of a large dataset . These videos were selected using specific keywords related to e-cigarettes, covering the period from 2018 to 2023. This helped capture the evolution of public discourse over time, with a particular focus on emerging trends and recent debates.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
671 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The use of the YouTube API guaranteed structured and filtered data extraction, respecting the constraints of the platform. This methodology provided a comprehensive and relevant body of data for analysis.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
672 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Data Cleaning)
/E (Data Cleaning)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
673 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Data cleaning was a crucial step to ensure the quality and relevance of the final dataset. Duplicates, irrelevant content and non-French comments were systematically removed using two AI models: the Roberta model and a language detection model, working in tandem. This rigorous process ensured that the final dataset contained exclusively French-language content relating to e-cigarettes.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
674 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The cleaned dataset now provides a solid basis for subsequent analyzes and future research into public perceptions of e-cigarettes in France.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
675 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Development of a Deep Learning Model)
/E (Development of a Deep Learning Model)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
676 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After data cleaning, a deep learning model was developed to automatically classify comments into three categories: favorable, unfavorable or neutral towards the use of e-cigarettes.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
677 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Model development required the creation of a manually labeled dataset. Around 4,000 comments were randomly selected and categorized by three different annotators. This process was validated using Fleiss' Kappa method to ensure agreement between annotators, ensuring the reliability of the dataset for model training.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
678 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <AB20436861726163746572697A6174696F6E206F6620436F6F7264696E61746564204265686176696F7220696E204F6E6C696E6520536F6369616C204D6564696120BB>
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [2]
>>
