<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The model was then trained using advanced neural network techniques, taking into account linguistic nuances such as idiomatic expressions and sarcasm, common in French discussions about e-cigarettes. Special measures have been taken to avoid biases, such as imbalances between favorable and unfavorable comments, which could distort the performance of the model.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
