<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Cumulative Distribution Functions \(CDFs\): These functions were generated to explore the distribution of user engagement \(e.g. likes and comments per video\). The results showed a very uneven distribution, where a small number of videos generated the majority of interactions, a typical phenomenon on social media platforms where a minority of content captures the majority of audience attention.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [7]
>>
