/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In conclusion, this project established a systematic and rigorous approach to analyze public perceptions of electronic cigarettes, particularly in the French context. The methodology, from data collection to analysis via deep learning models, provides a solid foundation for future research and contributes to a better understanding of the public discourse on e-cigarettes. In addition to offering direct implications for policy makers and healthcare professionals, this project presents an analytical framework extensible to other topics, enriching research on coordinated online behaviors.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
