/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This report presents the results of a research project conducted as part of a collaboration between the Higher Institute of Electronics and Digital \(ISEN\) and the Federal University of Ouro Preto \(UFOP\). Under the direction of Professor Carlos Henrique Gomes Ferreira, the project analyzes the dynamics of discussions surrounding electronic cigarettes across various countries, with a particular focus on France. By concentrating on comments and videos available on YouTube, this work aims to understand perceptions, debates, and the cultural and regulatory contexts associated with electronic cigarettes. The findings will provide valuable insights for policymakers and health professionals, while contributing to the scientific literature on this topic.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [7]
